      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.22,
          "end": 3.36,
          "en": "Instructor: In the last lecture,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.36,
          "end": 5.97,
          "en": "we styled our active links here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.97,
          "end": 7.29,
          "en": "Now, I want to fix the behavior",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.29,
          "end": 10.26,
          "en": "that whenever I click one of these recipe icons here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.26,
          "end": 11.94,
          "en": "we reload the page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.94,
          "end": 14.01,
          "en": "and that simply happens,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.01,
          "end": 16.77,
          "en": "if we have a look at our recipe list component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 16.77,
          "end": 19.83,
          "en": "which of course is responsible for displaying the list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 19.83,
          "end": 22.02,
          "en": "Here in the recipe item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 22.02,
          "end": 24.39,
          "en": "which is the individual item we're clicking,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 24.39,
          "end": 27.33,
          "en": "we have a link with this ref attribute here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 27.33,
          "end": 30.54,
          "en": "Let's remove it because that will actually send a request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 30.54,
          "end": 33.75,
          "en": "to the browser and therefore reload our page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 33.75,
          "end": 36.84,
          "en": "If we remove this, you see now I can click it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 36.84,
          "end": 41.37,
          "en": "but now we no longer get the cursor which looks like a hand.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.37,
          "end": 43.26,
          "en": "We can quickly add this manually though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.26,
          "end": 47.79,
          "en": "by simply adding style and then cursor equal to pointer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.79,
          "end": 49.17,
          "en": "And now we should have the pointer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.17,
          "end": 52.26,
          "en": "which clearly indicates that we can click this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.26,
          "end": 55.47,
          "en": "but now we don't reload the page anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 55.47,
          "end": 57.54,
          "en": "Now, for the dropdown here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.54,
          "end": 59.49,
          "en": "we should also make sure that all these links",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 59.49,
          "end": 60.84,
          "en": "are not reloading the page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 60.84,
          "end": 62.79,
          "en": "because right now they are,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 62.79,
          "end": 64.23,
          "en": "and that is something we have to fix",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 64.23,
          "end": 66.87,
          "en": "in the recipe detail component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 66.87,
          "end": 70.38,
          "en": "We also need to remove these ref elements here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 70.38,
          "end": 72.9,
          "en": "And I already added the style with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 72.9,
          "end": 75.18,
          "en": "the cursor which is set to a pointer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 75.18,
          "end": 77.28,
          "en": "to the first anchor tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 77.28,
          "end": 79.89,
          "en": "Let's also add it to the other two, and with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 79.89,
          "end": 81.63,
          "en": "that should be fixed too.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 81.63,
          "end": 84.53999999999999,
          "en": "Now, if we select something here, we don't reload.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 84.53999999999999,
          "end": 86.64,
          "en": "Let's now also do that for the dropdown.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 86.64,
          "end": 90.03,
          "en": "Right now, clicking the dropdown also reloads the page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 90.03,
          "end": 92.94,
          "en": "That of course has to be fixed in the header component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 92.94,
          "end": 95.00999999999999,
          "en": "And here we reload the page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 95.00999999999999,
          "end": 98.78999999999999,
          "en": "because our dropdown also has this anchor tag",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 98.78999999999999,
          "end": 101.13,
          "en": "or this ref attribute on it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 101.13,
          "end": 103.95,
          "en": "So, we should get rid of this and then maybe also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 103.95,
          "end": 107.34,
          "en": "implement this style cursor pointer set up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 107.34,
          "end": 109.8,
          "en": "to get the right mouse cursor.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 109.8,
          "end": 113.22,
          "en": "Let's also do the same for the individual anchor tags",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 113.22,
          "end": 115.44,
          "en": "inside of that dropdown.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 115.44,
          "end": 119.52000000000001,
          "en": "So, I also removed ref there and added my own cursor style.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 119.52000000000001,
          "end": 122.01,
          "en": "So, with that, this now all works fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 122.01,
          "end": 124.05,
          "en": "Of course, the dropdown doesn't do anything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 124.05,
          "end": 127.71,
          "en": "we'll add this later, but the app is working again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 127.71,
          "end": 130.86,
          "en": "and therefore we made a big step into the right direction.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 130.86,
          "end": 134.4,
          "en": "So, with this all added and set up here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 134.4,
          "end": 137.57999999999998,
          "en": "our root routes seem to be working fine,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 137.57999999999998,
          "end": 141.66,
          "en": "but now, I want to change the way we load the recipe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 141.66,
          "end": 143.82,
          "en": "when we click on one here in the list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 143.82,
          "end": 147.75,
          "en": "I actually want to load that via child routing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 147.75,
          "end": 149.37,
          "en": "When we click new recipe,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 149.37,
          "end": 154.35,
          "en": "I also want to load the to be created recipe edit component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 154.35,
          "end": 157.71,
          "en": "here on the right, where we now have the detail component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 157.71,
          "end": 160.74,
          "en": "and the same for the case that we click edit here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 160.74,
          "end": 163.65,
          "en": "So, that is something I definitely want to add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 163.65,
          "end": 166.86,
          "en": "I want to add these routes, these child routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 166.86,
